# FictionScreen AI Rules

## 🚨 ZERO OUTLINE (아웃라인 / 테두리선 전면 금지)
- Never use borders or outlines in UI components (cards, buttons, badges, modals, loading screens).
- No `border: Border.all(...)` in Flutter.
- No `border: ...` or `outline: ...` in CSS.
- Use soft surface contrast, blur, and ambient shadows instead.

## CupertinoIcons ONLY
- Never use Material `Icons.*`. Always use `CupertinoIcons.*`.

## ScaleButton Feedback
- All buttons must use `ScaleButton` with scale-down feedback.

## Theme Service
- Global theme must follow `AppThemeService.instance`.
